Something About Lola
Band labèl indie ingkang lair ing wiwitan taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Band%20Indie"&gt;Band Indie&lt;/a&gt; uga diarani SAL iki lair ing kutha &lt;a href="Semarang"&gt;Semarang&lt;/a&gt;. Diwiwita saka wangsa SMA, &lt;a href="Brintz"&gt;Brintz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Een"&gt;Een&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Rossy"&gt;Rossy&lt;/a&gt; damél band. Kanggo ngisi posisi drummer, banjur nyuwun marang &lt;a href="Alif"&gt;Alif&lt;/a&gt;, lan gitar &lt;a href="Arif"&gt;Arif&lt;/a&gt;.
Barèng mlakune band, Arif medal banjur diisi karo &lt;a href="Muny"&gt;Muny&lt;/a&gt;. Setaun miwiti medale Arif, &lt;a href="Alif"&gt;Alif&lt;/a&gt; nyusul medal, banjur diganti karo &lt;a href="Tommy"&gt;Tommy&lt;/a&gt;.
Muny gadhah wiwitan sekolah ing njaba kutha &lt;a href="Semarang"&gt;Semarang&lt;/a&gt;, banjur medal. &lt;a href="Een"&gt;Een&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dadi vokalis rikala iku, ngisi posisiné Muny, lan ngajak rencang &lt;a href="Combot"&gt;Combot&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngisi vokalis. Combot iku kontestan acara &lt;a href="Indonesian%20Idol"&gt;Indonesian Idol&lt;/a&gt;, nanging boten lolos sadaya.
Miwiti taun 2011, Something About Lola gadhah personil anyar, piyambake ngisi posisi uga anyar keybordis, ya iku &lt;a href="Rico"&gt;Rico&lt;/a&gt;.
SAL gadhah fans lan komunitas SAL asmane Eggtrops.
<h2>Album EP (Extended Play)</h2>
<h3>Menlove Avenue</h3>
Album EP (Extended Play).
Menlove Avenue.
Kaping pisan, saka taun lairé band, &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, Menlove Avenue iku album pertama SAL ingkang rilis taun 2008. Isiné cacah 4 lagu, ya iku Deloran Case, Fall of Fashion Designer, Majesty's Secret Services, lan Eggman's Art of Sleeping Awake.
<h3>Red Town</h3>
Red Town.
Red Town pungkasan album SAL rilis ing taun 2009. Album iki ana lagu ingkang didamel manèh dadi akustik, ya iku Majesty's Secret Services. Lagu anyar ya iku The Best Part Of Writing A Song Is To Named It lan Istanbul to Athens. Jumlah lagune namung 3 ing album iki.
<h2>Keybordist Anyar, Prabawa Anyar</h2>
<h3>Album EP Your Revolution</h3>
Keybordist Anyar, Prabawa Anyar.
Album EP Your Revolution.
Taun 2011, SAL miwiti lagu anyar ingkang judhulé Pandora's Eyes. Lagu iku kathah diaransemen karo &lt;a href="Rico"&gt;Rico&lt;/a&gt;, inggih boten liyané keyboardis anyare SAL. Rico iku uga keyboardis solo &lt;a href="Hellostereo"&gt;Hellostereo&lt;/a&gt;. Tèma lagu ing album Your Revolution iku ngajak para parungon lan uga Eggtroops miwiti semangat kanthi nguripi urip marang becik..
<h3>Something About Lola ing 2013</h3>
Something About Lola ing 2013.
SAL miwiti 2013, damel vidéo komedi kajudhul &lt;a href="Malam%20Minggu%20Rico"&gt;Malam Minggu Rico&lt;/a&gt;, digiyaraké ing saluran steaming &lt;a href="Seputar%20CB31%20TV"&gt;Seputar CB31 TV&lt;/a&gt; lan uga ing &lt;a href="Youtube"&gt;Youtube&lt;/a&gt;. Carita-carita ingkang diungghah iku namung fiksi utawa kanggo namung kanggo hiburan.
