<doc id="89259" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=89259" title="Gerard Kuiper">
Gerard Kuiper

Gerard Peter Kuiper (lair kanthi jeneng Gerrit Pieter Kuiper; &lt;a href="Harenkarspel"&gt;Harenkarspel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="7%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;7 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1905"&gt;1905&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Ciudad%20de%20Mexico"&gt;Ciudad de Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="23%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;23 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;) iku sawijining &lt;a href="astronom"&gt;astronom&lt;/a&gt; kalairan &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;. Dilairaké lan didhidhik ing &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;, Kuiper pindhah menyang &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1933"&gt;1933&lt;/a&gt; lan éntuk kawarganegaran &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1937"&gt;1937&lt;/a&gt;.
Kuiper nemu loro rembulan kanggo planit sajeroning Tata Surya, yaiku &lt;a href="Miranda"&gt;Miranda&lt;/a&gt;, rembulané &lt;a href="Uranus"&gt;Uranus&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Nereid"&gt;Nereid&lt;/a&gt;, rembulané &lt;a href="Neptunus"&gt;Neptunus&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga ngajokaké pendhapat yèn ana bunderan ing sanjabaning orbit &lt;a href="Neptunus"&gt;Neptunus&lt;/a&gt; sing saiki dijenengi &lt;a href="Sabuk%20Kuiper"&gt;Sabuk Kuiper&lt;/a&gt;, sing kawujudané wis dibuktèkaké (delengen &lt;a href="obj%C3%A8k%20trans-Neptunus"&gt;objèk trans-Neptunus&lt;/a&gt;). Kuiper uga ngrintis pangamatan infra udara migunakaké montor mabur &lt;a href="Convair%20990"&gt;Convair 990&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1960-an"&gt;1960-an&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1959"&gt;1959&lt;/a&gt;, Kuiper menangi Bebungah &lt;a href="Henry%20Norris%20Russell"&gt;Henry Norris Russell&lt;/a&gt; saka Persatuan Astronomi Amérika.
Nalika taun 1960-an, Kuiper mbiyantu ngidhèntifikasi tapak pandharatan ing rembulan kanggo program &lt;a href="Apollo"&gt;Apollo&lt;/a&gt;.
