<doc id="89286" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=89286" title="Abdurrahman bin Auf">
Abdurrahman bin Auf

Abdurrahman bin Auf (&lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;: عبد الرحمن بن عوف, lair 10 taun sawisé &lt;a href="Taun%20Gajah"&gt;Taun Gajah&lt;/a&gt; – séda &lt;a href="652"&gt;652&lt;/a&gt; nalika umur 72 taun) ya iku &lt;a href="sahabat%20Nabi"&gt;sahabat&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt; kang misuwur. Dhèwèké ya iku salah siji saka wolung wong pisanan (&lt;a href="Pemeluk%20Islam%20pisanan"&gt;As-Sabiqunal Aw-Walun&lt;/a&gt;) kang nampa agama &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku rong dina sawisé &lt;a href="Abu%20Bakar"&gt;Abu Bakar&lt;/a&gt;.
Abdurrahman bin Auf asalé saka &lt;a href="Bani%20Zuhrah"&gt;Bani Zuhrah&lt;/a&gt;. Salah sawijining sahabat Nabi liyané, ya iku &lt;a href="Sa%27ad%20bin%20Abi%20Waqqas"&gt;Sa'ad bin Abi Waqqas&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku ipene. Abdurrahman uga garwa saka sadulur tunggal ibu &lt;a href="Utsman%20bin%20Affan"&gt;Utsman bin Affan&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku anak wadon saka Urwa bint Kariz (ibu Utsman) karo garwa kapindhone.
Kaum muslimin lumrahé nganggep yèn Abdurrahman ya iku salah saiji saka Sepuluh Wong kang Dijamin Lumebu Swurga.
