Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: العباس بن عبد المطلب) (lair &lt;a href="566"&gt;566&lt;/a&gt; – séda &lt;a href="653"&gt;653&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku pak dhe lan &lt;a href="Sahabat%20Nabi"&gt;Sahabat&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;. Keturunan saka Abbas kang dadi golongan khalifah kang misuwur kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Bani%20Abbasiyah"&gt;Bani Abbasiyah&lt;/a&gt; kang tau kwasa ing &lt;a href="Baghdad"&gt;Baghdad&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Keturunan</h2>
Keturunan.
Abbas duwé 5 keturunan, ing antarané ya iku
<ol>
<li>&lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Abdullah bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, kang kerep ingaran Ibnu Abbas. Dhèwèké tau dadi gubernur ing &lt;a href="Basrah"&gt;Basrah&lt;/a&gt; nalika Khalifah &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali bin Abi Thalib&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké séda lan dikuburake ing Thaif, &lt;a href="Arab%20Saudi"&gt;Arab Saudi&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ubaidillah%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Ubaidillah bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, tau dadi gubernur ing &lt;a href="Yaman"&gt;Yaman&lt;/a&gt; ing mangsa Khalifah Ali bin Abi Thalib lan dikuburake ing &lt;a href="Madinah"&gt;Madinah&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Fahdl%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Fahdl bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, dikuburake ing Syam.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Qutsam%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Qutsam bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, tau dadi gubernur ing &lt;a href="Bahrain"&gt;Bahrain&lt;/a&gt; ing mangsa &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali bin Abi Thalib&lt;/a&gt; lan dikuburake ing &lt;a href="Samarkand"&gt;Samarkand&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Ma%27bad%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Ma'bad bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, tau dadi gubernur ing &lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt; nalika mangsa Khalifah &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali bin Abi Thalib&lt;/a&gt; lan dikuburake ing &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
