<doc id="89303" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=89303" title="Abdullah bin Abdul-Asad">
Abdullah bin Abdul-Asad

Abdullah bin Abdul-Asad (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;:بن عبد الأسد‎ عبد الله) yaiku salah siji &lt;a href="Sahabat%20Nabi"&gt;Sahabat Nabi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake yaiku Abdullah bin Abdul Asad al-Makhzumi, misuwur kanthi jeneng Abu Salamah, dhèwèké nandhang tatu sajeroning &lt;a href="perang%20Uhud"&gt;perang Uhud&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi salah siji wong kang mati &lt;a href="syahid"&gt;syahid&lt;/a&gt;. Abu salamah uga disusoni déning &lt;a href="Thaubiyah"&gt;Thaubiyah&lt;/a&gt;, kang uga tau nyusoni Muhammad.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Dhèwèké bebarenga karo garwane yaiku &lt;a href="Ummu%20Salamah%20Hindun%20binti%20Abu%20Umayah"&gt;Ummu Salamah Hindun binti Abu Umayah&lt;/a&gt; minangka sahabat lkang pisanan nganut agama Islam. Kekarone duwé anak papat, yaiku Salama, Umar, Zainab, lan Durra. Sawisé wafate Abdullah bin Abdul-Asad, Ummu Salamah Hindun binti Abu Umayah krama karo Muhammad. Abu Salamah tau mèlu ijrah ing &lt;a href="Ethiopia"&gt;Ethiopia&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké kaloka amarga kendelé lan kapinterane nunggang &lt;a href="jaran"&gt;jaran&lt;/a&gt;.
