<doc id="89363" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=89363" title="Bani Hasyim">
Bani Hasyim

Bani Hasyim (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;: بنو هاشم) yaiku salah siji marga/klan ing suku &lt;a href="Quraish"&gt;Quraish&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt; yaiku anggota saka marga iki; bapak saka simbah kakung Muhammad yaiku &lt;a href="Hasyim%20bin%20Abdul%20Manaf"&gt;Hasyim bin Abdul Manaf&lt;/a&gt;. Anggota saka marga iki kerep diarani Hashemites utawa &lt;a href="Hasyimiyah"&gt;Hasyimiyah&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<h3>Silsilah</h3>
Sajarah.
Silsilah.
Bani Hasyim yaiku anggota saka marga &lt;a href="Bani%20Abdul%20Manaf"&gt;Bani Abdul Manaf&lt;/a&gt;, marga kang paling kajèn ing suku &lt;a href="Quraish"&gt;Quraish&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané Bani Hasyim, cabang liyané saka marga Bani Abdul Manaf yaiku &lt;a href="Bani%20Muththalib"&gt;Bani Muththalib&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bani%20Abdus%20Syams"&gt;Bani Abdus Syams&lt;/a&gt; kang ngedunake&lt;a href="Bani%20Umayyah"&gt;Bani Umayyah&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku Bani Hasyim uga ngedunake &lt;a href="Bani%20Abbasiyah"&gt;Bani Abbasiyah&lt;/a&gt; kang candhaké nindakaké kakhalifahan sawisé ngalahake &lt;a href="Bani%20Umayyah"&gt;Bani Umayyah&lt;/a&gt;.
Abdul Manaf dhéwé sejatine ateges "abdi (hamba) saka Manaf". Déné &lt;a href="Manaf"&gt;Manaf&lt;/a&gt; yaiku salah siji déwa kang dipuja-puja déning bangsa Arab suku Quraish lan sakiteré nalika mangsa pra-Islam.
<h3>Abu Thalib</h3>
Abu Thalib.
Sawisé simbah kakunge Muhammad yaiku &lt;a href="Abdul%20Muthalib"&gt;Abdul Muthalib&lt;/a&gt; séda, &lt;a href="Abu%20Thalib"&gt;Abu Thalib&lt;/a&gt;, pamane &lt;a href="Muhammad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt; dadi kepala marga. Bani Hasyim yaiku salah siji marga wigati ing suku &lt;a href="Quraish"&gt;Quraish&lt;/a&gt; nalika kelairane Muhammad. Iki amarga tugas Bani Hasyim yaiku njaga Ka'bah.
Ing mangsa wiwitan kenabian saka Muhammad, pamane &lt;a href="Abu%20Thalib"&gt;Abu Thalib&lt;/a&gt; minangka kepala marga, lan dhèwèké éntuk tekanan punjul saka sekabehing suku &lt;a href="Quraish"&gt;Quraish&lt;/a&gt; amarga panyebaran agama kang ditindakake Muhammad. Sanajan mangkono, Abu Thalib ora tau mandheg njurung Muhammad. Anak Abu Thalib, &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali&lt;/a&gt; yaiku wong lanang panganut &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt; pisanan lan garwane puteri Muhammad, &lt;a href="Fatimah%20az-Zahra"&gt;Fatimah az-Zahra&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Peranan Bani Hasyim</h3>
Peranan Bani Hasyim.
Abu Thalib lan sadulur-seduluré duwé peran yaiku mènèhi panganan lan ombenan marang peziarah kang teka ana Makkah saben taune saperlu nekani &lt;a href="Ka%27bah"&gt;Ka'bah&lt;/a&gt;, kang diyasa déning Ibrahim. Nalika iku, brahala saka pirang-pirang suku dideleh ana &lt;a href="Ka%27bah"&gt;Ka'bah&lt;/a&gt;, punjul 300.
<h3>Boikot marang Bani Hasyim</h3>
Boikot marang Bani Hasyim.
Taun 617-619, kedadeyan &lt;a href="Boikot%20Quraish%20marang%20Bani%20Hasyim%20lan%20Muhammad"&gt;Boikot Quraish marang Bani Hasyim lan Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;.
