<doc id="89372" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=89372" title="Imam Nawawi">
Imam Nawawi

Al-Imam al-Allamah Abu Zakaria Muhyuddin bin Syaraf an-Nawawi ad-Dimasyqi (الإمام العلامة أبو زكريا محيي الدين بن شرف النووي الدمشقي), utawa Imam Nawawi, sawijining &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; madahab &lt;a href="Syafi%27i"&gt;Syafi'i&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengané miyos ing désa Nawa, sacedhaké kutha &lt;a href="Damaskus"&gt;Damaskus&lt;/a&gt;, ing taun &lt;a href="1233"&gt;1233&lt;/a&gt;M lan surud ing taun &lt;a href="1278"&gt;1278&lt;/a&gt;M. Papan loro iku mau banjur dadi nisbat asmané, an-Nawawi ad-Dimasyqi. Panjenengané ulama kang winasis ing babagan &lt;a href="fiqih"&gt;fiqih&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="hadis"&gt;hadis&lt;/a&gt;.
Imam Nawawi pindhah ing Damaskus taun 649 H lan manggon ana destrik Rawahibiyah. Ing papan iki panjenengane sinau lan ngapalake kita at-Tanbih ing wektu patang sasi lan ngapalake kitab al-Muhadzdzabb ing sasi sabanjuré mranag guruné, Syaikh Kamal Ibnu Ahmad.
Nalika sugengé, panjenengane sibuk nggulawenthah ngèlmu, nulis kitab, mulang ngaji, ng&lt;a href="ibadah"&gt;ibadah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="wirid"&gt;wirid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pasa"&gt;pasa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="dzikir"&gt;dzikir&lt;/a&gt;, lan sabar marang apa kang dilakoni.
<h2>Guru-guru Imam Nawawi</h2>
Guru-guru Imam Nawawi.
Sang Imam sinau marang guru-guru sing misuwur kaya déné &lt;a href="Abdul%20Aziz%20bin%20Muhammad%20Al-Ashari"&gt;Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad Al-Ashari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zainuddin%20bin%20Abdud%20Daim"&gt;Zainuddin bin Abdud Daim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Imaduddin%20bin%20Abdul%20Karim%20Al-Harastani"&gt;Imaduddin bin Abdul Karim Al-Harastani&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zainuddin%20Abul%20Baqa"&gt;Zainuddin Abul Baqa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Khalid%20bin%20Yusuf"&gt;Khalid bin Yusuf&lt;/a&gt; Al-Maqdisi An-Nabalusi dan &lt;a href="Jamaluddin%20Ibn%20Ash-Shairafi"&gt;Jamaluddin Ibn Ash-Shairafi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taqiyuddin%20bin%20Abul%20Yusri"&gt;Taqiyuddin bin Abul Yusri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Syamsuddin%20bin%20Abu%20Umar"&gt;Syamsuddin bin Abu Umar&lt;/a&gt;. Panjenengané sinau &lt;a href="fiqih"&gt;fiqih&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="hadis"&gt;hadis&lt;/a&gt; (seserepan hadis) marang asy-Syaikh al-Muhaqqiq &lt;a href="Abu%20Ishaq%20Ibrahim%20bin%20Isa"&gt;Abu Ishaq Ibrahim bin Isa&lt;/a&gt; Al-Muradi Al-Andalusi. Banjur sinau fiqh marang Al-Kamal &lt;a href="Ishaq%20bin%20Ahmad%20bin%20usman"&gt;Ishaq bin Ahmad bin usman&lt;/a&gt; Al-Maghribi Al-Maqdisi, &lt;a href="Syamsuddin%20Abdurrahman%20bin%20Nuh"&gt;Syamsuddin Abdurrahman bin Nuh&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Izzuddin%20Al-Arbili"&gt;Izzuddin Al-Arbili&lt;/a&gt; sarta guru-guru liyané.
<h2>Murid-murid Imam Nawawi</h2>
Murid-murid Imam Nawawi.
Ora sethithik ulama sing mara sinau marang Iman Nawawi. Antara liya ya iku al-Khatib &lt;a href="Shadruddin%20Sulaiman%20al-Ja%E2%80%99fari"&gt;Shadruddin Sulaiman al-Ja’fari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Syihabuddin%20al-Arbadi"&gt;Syihabuddin al-Arbadi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shihabuddin%20bin%20Ja%E2%80%99wan"&gt;Shihabuddin bin Ja’wan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Alauddin%20al-Athar"&gt;Alauddin al-Athar&lt;/a&gt; lan sing ngriwayataké hadis kaya &lt;a href="Ibnu%20Abil%20Fath"&gt;Ibnu Abil Fath&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Al-Mazi"&gt;Al-Mazi&lt;/a&gt; lan sapanunggalané.
