Soto Bandhung iki kaperang saka &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sapi"&gt;sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="lobak"&gt;lobak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sega"&gt;sega putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kedhel%C3%A9"&gt;kedhelé&lt;/a&gt; ditambah garnis tomat, &lt;a href="sel%C3%A8dri"&gt;selèdri&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="bawang"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; goreng. Soto Bandhung uga bisa dicawisake karo &lt;a href="berged%C3%A8l"&gt;bergedèl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="t%C3%A9mp%C3%A9"&gt;témpé&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="krupuk"&gt;krupuk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="jeruk%20nipis"&gt;jeruk nipis&lt;/a&gt;.
Soto Bandhung kang misuwur kawit biyèn (wiwit taun 1955) yaiku Soto Bandhung M. Tarya. Menu favorit Soto Bandhung iki yaiku nalika ditambahi perkedel kenthang kang isih anget ditambah emping.
