<li>&lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Ben%20Johnson"&gt;Ben Johnson&lt;/a&gt;, pelari cepat &lt;a href="100"&gt;100&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="m%C3%A8ter"&gt;mèter&lt;/a&gt; dicopot gelar juarane amarga nganggo &lt;a href="Anabolic%20Steroid"&gt;Anabolic Steroid&lt;/a&gt;ing &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Soul"&gt;Olimpiade Soul&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
